From 02d817642a114e0a8b8e12080cc43daaa629e595 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Malard <malard@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 10:40:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [buildsteps][depends] Prepare depends in one function shared
 by every platform

The clean, cache and restore steps were repeated in ten prepare-depends
scripts; they are now prepareDepends in defaultenv.

A BUILD_CACHE_ENTRIES that is not a number falls back to the default of 2.
Before, a value such as "two" pruned every cached build but the current one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
